    slots: [{"key":"seo.metaTitle","kind":"text","group":"SEO","label":"Page title","def":"Digital Marketing Agency in Blainville | Davnoot"},{"key":"seo.metaDescription","kind":"text","group":"SEO","label":"Meta description","def":"Davnoot helps Blainville businesses grow with SEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, and AI search optimization. Local strategy, senior operators, no junior guesswork. Book a free call."},{"key":"hero.badge","kind":"inline","group":"Hero","label":"hero.badge","def":"Digital marketing · Blainville, Quebec"},{"key":"hero.title","kind":"inline","group":"Hero","label":"hero.title","def":"Digital marketing<br />agency in <em>Blainville</em>."},{"key":"hero.sub","kind":"inline","group":"Hero","label":"hero.sub","def":"Blainville is one of the fastest-growing suburbs on Montreal's North Shore, with new residential development driving steady demand for local home services, healthcare, and retail. If you run a business in Blainville, you already know the North Shore market rewards the companies that show up first — on Google, on Maps, and increasingly in AI answers. Davnoot is a Montreal-based growth agency that builds and runs the marketing systems that make that happen."},{"key":"section1.eyebrow","kind":"inline","group":"Who we work with","label":"section1.eyebrow","def":"Who we work with"},{"key":"section1.title","kind":"inline","group":"Who we work with","label":"section1.title","def":"Who we work with<br />in <em>Blainville</em>."},{"key":"section1.sub","kind":"inline","group":"Who we work with","label":"section1.sub","def":"We've built campaigns for home service providers, healthcare clinics, and retailers serving Blainville's growing population — the kinds of businesses that live and die by local visibility. Blainville isn't a satellite market to us; it's covered by the same senior team that runs our Montreal accounts, with the same weekly reporting and monthly strategy reviews."},{"key":"section2.eyebrow","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"section2.eyebrow","def":"What we do"},{"key":"section2.title","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"section2.title","def":"What we <em>do</em>."},{"key":"services.0.title","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"services.0.title","def":"<a href=\"/services/seo\" class=\"text-link\" data-cursor>Local SEO</a>"},{"key":"services.0.desc","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"services.0.desc","def":"Google Business Profile optimization, city-specific landing pages, and the on-page work that gets Blainville searches to convert."},{"key":"services.1.title","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"services.1.title","def":"<a href=\"/services/google-ads\" class=\"text-link\" data-cursor>Google Ads</a> and <a href=\"/services/meta-ads\" class=\"text-link\" data-cursor>Meta Ads</a>"},{"key":"services.1.desc","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"services.1.desc","def":"Campaigns built around your actual sales cycle, not a generic playbook."},{"key":"services.2.title","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"services.2.title","def":"<a href=\"/services/ai-seo\" class=\"text-link\" data-cursor>AI search optimization</a>"},{"key":"services.2.desc","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"services.2.desc","def":"Showing up when people ask ChatGPT or Gemini who to call, not just when they Google it."},{"key":"services.3.title","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"services.3.title","def":"<a href=\"/services/email\" class=\"text-link\" data-cursor>Email marketing and automation</a>"},{"key":"services.3.desc","kind":"inline","group":"What we do","label":"services.3.desc","def":"Plus <a href=\"/services/software\" class=\"text-link\" data-cursor>custom software</a> when your growth outpaces off-the-shelf tools."},{"key":"section3.eyebrow","kind":"inline","group":"How we start","label":"section3.eyebrow","def":"How we start"},{"key":"section3.title","kind":"inline","group":"How we start","label":"section3.title","def":"How we <em>start</em>."},{"key":"section3.sub","kind":"inline","group":"How we start","label":"section3.sub","def":"Every engagement opens with an audit — we look at your site, your rankings, your ad accounts (if you have them), and your competitors, and we tell you what's actually leaking. From there we build a 90-day plan with real metrics attached, not a list of deliverables nobody asked for."},{"key":"section3.sub2","kind":"inline","group":"How we start","label":"section3.sub2","def":"Population growth on the North Shore is a rising tide — we make sure your business, not just your competitors, benefits from every new household that moves in."},{"key":"cta.eyebrow","kind":"inline","group":"Final CTA","label":"cta.eyebrow","def":"Digital marketing in Blainville"},{"key":"cta.title","kind":"inline","group":"Final CTA","label":"cta.title","def":"Find out where<br />the <em>opportunity</em> is."},{"key":"cta.sub","kind":"inline","group":"Final CTA","label":"cta.sub","def":"Book a free 30-minute strategy call and we will show you exactly where the opportunity is in Blainville."}],
