    slots: [{"key":"seo.metaTitle","kind":"text","group":"SEO","label":"Page title","def":"Google Ads and PPC Pricing | Davnoot"},{"key":"seo.metaDescription","kind":"text","group":"SEO","label":"Meta description","def":"See how Davnoot structures Google Ads and PPC management fees, what ad spend ranges make sense, and what's included at every level."},{"key":"hero.badge","kind":"inline","group":"Hero","label":"hero.badge","def":"Pricing · Google Ads"},{"key":"hero.title","kind":"inline","group":"Hero","label":"hero.title","def":"What Google Ads<br />management <em>costs</em>."},{"key":"hero.sub","kind":"inline","group":"Hero","label":"hero.sub","def":"<a href=\"/services/google-ads\" class=\"text-link\" data-cursor>PPC pricing</a> has two parts: what you spend with Google, and what you pay us to manage it. We're upfront that these are separate — your ad spend goes to Google's auction, our fee covers strategy, build, and ongoing optimization."},{"key":"section1.eyebrow","kind":"inline","group":"How our management fee works","label":"section1.eyebrow","def":"How our management fee works"},{"key":"section1.title","kind":"inline","group":"How our management fee works","label":"section1.title","def":"How the management<br />fee <em>works</em>."},{"key":"section1.p0","kind":"inline","group":"How our management fee works","label":"section1.p0","def":"We typically structure fees as a flat monthly retainer scaled to account complexity, not a percentage of spend — a percentage model quietly incentivizes an agency to push your budget up even when it shouldn't. Retainers cover campaign strategy, keyword and audience research, ad creative, <a href=\"/services/software\" class=\"text-link\" data-cursor>landing page recommendations</a>, bid management, and weekly reporting with a monthly strategy review."},{"key":"section2.eyebrow","kind":"inline","group":"What affects the price","label":"section2.eyebrow","def":"What affects the price"},{"key":"section2.title","kind":"inline","group":"What affects the price","label":"section2.title","def":"What affects<br />the <em>price</em>."},{"key":"section2.list.0.desc","kind":"inline","group":"What affects the price","label":"section2.list.0.desc","def":"Number of campaigns and ad platforms (Search, <a href=\"/services/google-ads\" class=\"text-link\" data-cursor>Performance Max</a>, Shopping, YouTube, or a mix)."},{"key":"section2.list.1.title","kind":"inline","group":"What affects the price","label":"section2.list.1.title","def":"Account history"},{"key":"section2.list.1.desc","kind":"inline","group":"What affects the price","label":"section2.list.1.desc","def":"A fresh account needs more building than one we're optimizing."},{"key":"section2.list.2.desc","kind":"inline","group":"What affects the price","label":"section2.list.2.desc","def":"Conversion tracking complexity, especially for multi-step or offline sales cycles."},{"key":"section2.list.3.desc","kind":"inline","group":"What affects the price","label":"section2.list.3.desc","def":"Whether landing pages need to be built or rebuilt to convert the traffic we're driving."},{"key":"section2.p0","kind":"inline","group":"What affects the price","label":"section2.p0","def":"There's no minimum ad spend requirement to work with us, but we'll tell you honestly if your budget is too thin to get meaningful data — wasting your money isn't how we build long-term clients."},{"key":"cta.eyebrow","kind":"inline","group":"Final CTA","label":"cta.eyebrow","def":"Google Ads pricing"},{"key":"cta.title","kind":"inline","group":"Final CTA","label":"cta.title","def":"Find out what<br />your account <em>needs</em>."},{"key":"cta.sub","kind":"inline","group":"Final CTA","label":"cta.sub","def":"Book a free 30-minute strategy call and we will show you exactly where the opportunity is — and tell you honestly if your budget is too thin to get meaningful data."}],
